<title>USA: Steven Madden April same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Steven Madden April same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steven Madden Ltd on Monday said April 1997 same-store sales increased 21 percent to $293,500, compared with $243,000 last year.</p>
<p>Steven Madden designs and markets fashion footwear for women.  The shoes are sold through the company's retail stores and footwear and apparel specialty stores.</p>
